{c: Verse 1}
[Am]keh doon tumhe
[A]ya chup rahoon
[A]dil mein mere [G]aaj kya hai
[Am]jo bolo [G]to jaanoon
[Am]guru tumko manoon
[Am]chalo [A]ye bhi [Am]waada hai
[A]socha hai [G]tumne ki [A]chalte hi jaaye
[A]taaro se [G]aage koi [A]duniya basaayein
theek hai....aah haan,        to tum batao...bata oon...haan
[A]socha hai [G]ye ki [A]tumhe rasta bhulaye
[A]suni jagah [G]pe kahin [A]chhede daraaye
[G]Are na na hai re naa Na ye na karna
[A]are nahi re nahi re
[A]nahi re nahi re nahi re Nahi Re
[A]nahi re nahi nahi
[Am]Kehdoon tumhe.....
[A]socha hai [G]tumne ki [A]kuch gun gunaye
[A]masti me [G]jhume zara [A]dhoome machaye
ab theek hai...hoon hoon,        to tum batao na...bataa oon..haan
[A]socha hai [G]ye ki [A]tumhe nazdik laye
[A]phoolo se [G]hotho ki [A]laali churaye
[G]Are na na hai re naa Na ye na karna
[A]are nahi re nahi re
[A]nahi re nahi re nahi re Nahi Re
